WEBVTT

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:36.120
I'm so dense.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:43.200
Godai's so nice, I assumed
he had feelings for me.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:54.780
It never occurred to me that
he had a woman like that.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.890
I'm such an idiot!

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:03.830
"A woman like that"?

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:08.490
Akemi at Maison Ikkoku.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:09.860
What?

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:11.920
No way.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.570
I saw them! I saw them
coming out of a hotel!

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:45.430
No way... It can't be true.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:51.070
Maybe I'll seduce Godai...

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:55.630
Even Akemi wouldn't take
a prank this far...

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.200
Maybe I'll seduce him...

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.010
Maybe I'll seduce him...

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:12.480
Why isn't the manager home yet?

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.800
What's taking her so long?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:22.490
Snack Chachamaru

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.700
I know. Welco-

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.820
What's up, Manager?

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.610
Why don't you go straight
to Maison Ikkoku?

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.140
well...

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:48.760
They're all
waiting for you.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.800
well

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.070
Um...

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:56.200
Huh?

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:05.050
I get it! You're too
embarrassed to go back

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:06.910
after all the
trouble you've caused!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:11.270
Don't worry! Nobody cares.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.380
I'll call them for you.
They're all home.

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:21.100
Akemi, I haven't...

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:26.860
Hey! It's me.
Manager's here.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:30.630
...decided to go back yet.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:33.300
Okay! See ya.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.000
Did you say something?

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.810
I have something
I want to ask you.

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.310
Ask me?

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:06.370
I...

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:11.350
I ran into... Kozue in front
of the train station.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:15.670
Kozue? So you heard.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:21.610
that she saw Godai and
me come out of a hotel.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:28.920
so?

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:33.970
Well, so.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:37.730
It's true.

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:53.210
Welc-

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:57.730
What's up?

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.820
She stopped moving.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:05.970
Godai, is it true that you
went to a hotel with Akemi?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.340
She moved!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.600
Akemi!

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:12.210
It's the truth, isn't it?

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:17.420
I'm innocent!
I didn't do anything!

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:21.670
I HATE YOU!

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.680
I'm going to quit
being the manager.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:35.590
Kyoko, I honestly
didn't do anything!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.060
Please believe me!

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:41.630
Forget it.
Do whatever you want.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.480
What actually happened?

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:48.360
Even if I say nothing
happened, she won't listen.

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.810
If Godai and I
connected physically,

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.670
there's no connection
of the heart.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:55.920
It's as if
nothing happened.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:57.850
There was no connection!

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:00.880
Fine. Forget it.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:06.790
You can just
be Akemi's gigolo!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.800
What did you say?!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.370
What? Hit me.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.610
Go ahead.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.370
If you feel no ounce
of guilt, go ahead.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:31.380
Hit me!

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:32.850
But.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:38.290
You keep spewing
out nonsense.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:44.490
Coward! Lowlife!
Two-timer! Scum!

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.540
Please let me explain.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:06.120
I hate you.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:10.900
The bill...

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.730
Look at that pathetic face.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:23.730
Why scream and cry over a guy
who won't even hold your hand?

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:29.000
I wouldn't bother to
snatch away a man

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.990
from a troublesome woman
like you.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:32.960
Idiot.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.550
She forgot her
dog and luggage.

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:41.950
Leave 'em.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:47.830
At least take her her coat.
It's getting chilly.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.430
Gee whiz. What a production.

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.590
You're the one
who dropped the bomb.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.740
They say adversity
builds character.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.550
I quit! I don't want to
be the manager anymore!

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.440
Who wants to go through
this every day?!

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:56.300
Nothing happened
between Akemi and me.

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:59.300
Stop it. Not here.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:04.720
I know I'm distrustful.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.300
I can't help it.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:16.380
We have nothing between us
that I can base my trust on.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.660
Can we talk a little more?

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:31.960
Don't you have work?

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.550
Please. How about
while we walk?

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:45.300
Everything's been
a misunderstanding,

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.210
and you'll see
if you'd only listen.

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:53.520
But you have no
faith in me, Kyoko.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:57.260
So this is all my fault?

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:58.530
No.

00:10:58.910 --> 00:10:59.630
But...

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.640
you're forgetting
what's most important.

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.870
What is most important?

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.470
How I feel about you.

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:17.650
I love you.

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:21.150
I love you, Kyoko.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.550
From the moment I met you.

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:29.580
now, and forever.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:37.300
S-So, I need you
to believe that.

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:40.510
T-This isn't fair.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:48.190
It sounds like you're
trying to deceive me.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:51.570
No! How do I get
through to you?!

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:56.080
But what about
those other women?

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:59.520
I'm not smooth enough to
court several women at once!

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:03.180
But--!

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:08.350
Can't you see that you're
the center of my world?

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:10.760
You the only one for me.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.300
Kozue?

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:41.770
Yotsuya!

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:43.640
What a coincidence.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.840
Is something troubling you?

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:49.040
You look depressed.

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:50.120
No.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:51.720
Oh.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.560
How's Godai doing?

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:10.430
He's been looking like
he's about to die

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:12.320
Since you dumped him...

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:16.450
Please. I'm the one
who got dumped.

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:19.670
I hadn't heard!

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:23.600
It's Godai's loss, isn't it?

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:26.870
But I saw Godai and Akemi.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.600
You're speaking of
the hotel incident?

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:40.580
She had him come
to lend her money

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.030
to pay her hotel bill?

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:46.560
Right. That's all it was.

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:35.020
Can't you see that you're
the center of my world?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.840
You're the only one for me.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:46.060
I'm so exhausted from
being too stubborn.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.920
I want to be
more true to myself.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:54.490
More true to myself.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:06.460
Come! Come on in!

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:09.970
Take advantage
of our low prices!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.950
Sir! For a low, low price-

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.320
I'm sorry!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:20.520
Godai, you fool!
What time do you think it is?

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:22.780
I'm sorry.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:28.090
I was having a very
important talk, and-

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:33.170
Her?

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:35.860
Right?

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:39.040
I'm sorry.

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:42.470
Why you little-

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.450
You got a guest.

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:47.480
Guest?

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:54.820
Chief!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.320
Chief, you're late!

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:58.950
Sorry!

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:01.420
Kozue...?

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:18.240
Why did she come?

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:20.740
Let's play, Chief!

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:23.070
Let's do origami!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:26.280
Sorry. Just a moment, okay?

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:30.250
I'm sorry. I must
be interrupting your work.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:35.990
I never thought
you'd come to see me.

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:41.070
I heard the truth.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.800
You just went to lend Akemi
money for her hotel bill

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:47.290
and that nothing
happened between you.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:52.280
I'm sorry, Godai, for
not believing in you.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.310
I'm really sorry.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:17:00.660
Please. I'm the one who
should apologize to you.

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:06.430
Hey, Godai. Come.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:14.130
Company Rule #2. Say it.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:19.170
Yes. Private business is
prohibited at the work site.

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:23.440
What's wrong with you?

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.210
First you come late
because of your woman.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:28.450
Then you're flirting
in front of the kids.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:30.770
I wasn't flirting.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:36.370
There's something I need
to make clear to her.

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:39.830
You're breaking up with her?

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.670
Then it's really something
you shouldn't be doing

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:45.400
in front of the kids.

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:47.170
No.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:51.530
There, there.

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.200
Sorry, sorry!

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:55.440
I was trying to comfort her.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.270
Give her to me.

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:02.000
It's okay.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:05.860
Good girl

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:12.010
You're so good, Godai!

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:16.410
You're going to make
a great preschool teacher.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.520
T-Think so?

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:21.400
Yes, I'm glad to see that.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:26.230
I knew she came here to
try to get back together.

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.450
But I have to make
it clear to her,

00:18:29.890 --> 00:18:31.780
or else I'll end up
hurting her even more.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.410
Are you warm enough?

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.170
I'm okay.

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:00.620
Kozue-

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.040
I...

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:06.420
Oh look! The moon is beautiful

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:11.090
It's beautiful

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:23.060
So, Kozue, there's something
I need to tell you. Um..

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:27.840
I haven't said anything yet.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:29.200
Godai!

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:33.900
Please don't hate me!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.190
Please!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.280
She cares for me that much?

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.690
But I have to tell her.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.290
Kozue, I'm really sorry.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.990
But I can't see you anymore.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:04.840
I'm in love with someone else.
I'm really sorry.

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:08.840
You have every right
to be bitter.

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:19.100
Who? Akemi?

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.590
Oh, no! Not her.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:26.900
Then who?
Someone I don't know?

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:30.390
Well... um...

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:32.870
Are you going to marry her?

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:37.200
Are you going to marry her?

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:43.980
We're not at that
stage yet, but I want to.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:49.150
A-And so.. I can't continue
to see you like this.

00:20:55.670 --> 00:21:01.190
I see. I'm glad
I came to see you.

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:04.700
I feel relieved.

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:09.870
I...

00:21:13.090 --> 00:21:14.450
decided to get married.

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:21.740
Married? To the man you
went to high school with?

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:25.090
Right after I
saw you and Akemi,

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:28.360
I decided to marry him.

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:34.720
And I told myself that
I wouldn't see you anymore.

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:38.080
Then I found out it was
all a misunderstanding.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.410
I didn't want us to
part ways on a sour note.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:45.700
I didn't want you to hate me
after we go our separate ways.

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:47.680
But.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:50.300
But now we're even.

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:05.130
I hope the man you're
marrying is a great guy.

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:07.260
He really is.

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:10.600
I think he truly loves me.

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:14.200
So I know I can trust him.

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:17.410
Let's say bye here.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:19.440
I'm going to hail a cab.

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:27.540
Say.

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:32.180
Congratulations.

00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:35.920
Thanks. Bye!

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:43.610
What's she like?
The woman you love?

00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:46.670
- Well...
- Wait!

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:51.940
Never mind.
Good-bye. Take care.

00:23:00.550 --> 00:23:01.650
Good-bye.

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:15.630
What's she like?

00:23:16.840 --> 00:23:22.870
Kozue, the woman I love gets jealous

00:23:23.350 --> 00:23:24.800
and quick to
jump to conclusions.

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:27.760
She cries and gets angry...

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:34.270
but nothing makes me happier
than seeing her smile.

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:51.460
Congratulations!

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:53.640
You're going
to graduate!

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:55.200
Now all you have left
to do is to find a job.

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:56.660
and propose!

00:23:56.850 --> 00:23:58.740
It must be spring!
I'm so envious!

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:02.780
Next: Spring is in the Air!
Two Hearts in Love!!

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:05.470
Won't anyone marry me?
